WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.600
The grid, the road, the hospital, and the factory now run on data and AI. What keeps them safe when something goes wrong?

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.300
It starts in the physical world: energy, transportation, health, manufacturing.

3
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.200
Sensors measure what is happening, right now.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:19.200
A zero-trust network carries the data. Every device and every command is verified.

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:26.200
AI keeps a digital twin of the system, spots trouble early, and proposes what to do.

6
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:31.200
People stay in the loop. They approve, override, or ask why.

7
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.200
Approved commands travel back, and actuators act. The loop closes.

8
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.000
Sense. Communicate. Decide with people. Act. Nothing is trusted by default.
